= The Ministries Push Back

The permanent staff of Coruscant's ministries have never liked the Rim's demands, and they like a Caucus led by the Rimward faction even less. Relief manifests go missing. Grant applications are returned for the wrong form. Nobody refuses anything. Nothing happens.
